			"author": { "name": "老徐", "email": "laoxu@example.com" },
			"body": "顺手贴一下取评论那几行，文档里没写这么细：\n\n```ts\nconst slug = slugOfPath(\"/dynamic/2026-07-15-161529/\");\nconst comments = await fetchComments(slug);\nfor (const c of comments.slice().reverse()) render(c);\n```\n\n后端给的是新的一页在前，聊天要反过来读。",
			"minutesAgo": 1100
